This directory contains the Alembic migration environment for JARVIS Core.

Run Alembic commands from the repository root. Command-line migrations read
JARVIS_DATABASE_URL through app.core.config.get_settings(). Programmatic callers
may instead set Config.attributes["database_url"], which is useful for isolated
SQLite migration tests.

Apply all migrations with:

    alembic upgrade head

Create later candidate migrations with:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"

Always review autogenerated revisions before applying them.
